@patterns.decorator

Purpose:
  Add behavior without modifying original.

UseWhen:
  - need to extend behavior dynamically
  - subclassing is impractical
  - multiple combinations of behaviors

AvoidWhen:
  - fixed set of behaviors
  - modification is acceptable

Why:
  Provides flexible alternative to subclassing.

Related:
  @patterns.strategy

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
